category: Libs
requires: girepository-GLib2.0 girepository-Json1.0 libglib2.0-devel libgusb2
sdesc: "GObject wrapper for libusb1 (GObject Introspection data)"
ldesc: "GUsb is a GObject wrapper for libusb1 that makes it easy to do asynchronous
control, bulk and interrupt transfers with proper cancellation and integration
into a mainloop. This makes it easy to integrate low level USB transfers with
your high-level application or system daemon."
external-source: libgusb

